Came, came, came, came,
came, came, came, came

9
00:00:49,220 --> 00:00:52,420
Ōki, Hachi, Ōno, Mishuku, Noya, Kujūkuri no

10
00:00:52,420 --> 00:00:55,280
The scent of the south wind

11
00:00:55,280 --> 00:00:58,380
about the size of Big Yoshiri,
little Yoshiri, Chikkun's one

12
00:00:59,020 --> 00:00:59,740
on the shore

13
